Here is the overview per option. Training is two weeks in all cases, split by=
 shift. Data migration is about four weeks including two test loads.

Option 13 Feb leaves three weeks between the end of training and the cut-over=
, which is fine for the dress rehearsal and still leaves a fallback slot on 2=
7 Feb. Option 16 Jan puts the training in the December peak, which Jeroen alr=
eady flagged.

Option | Data migration starts | Training | Dress rehearsal | Cut-over weekend
16 Jan 2027 | 9 Nov | 7-18 Dec | 8-9 Jan | 16-17 Jan
30 Jan 2027 | 30 Nov | 4-15 Jan | 22-23 Jan | 30-31 Jan
13 Feb 2027 | 4 Jan | 18-29 Jan | 5-6 Feb | 13-14 Feb

Thanks,
